{"payload":{"actual_answer":"给定记录显示，验收门只检查“结论”和“依据”字段是否存在，却把字段齐全当作事实已验证。库存为正、为负的相反结论都能通过，说明该门只能证明结构完整，不能证明库存事实；现有材料也不足以判断真实库存。\n\n最小修复是把“结构通过”与“事实验证通过”分成两个状态。字段检查仍由规则执行；库存结论须关联可核对的库存数据、对象和时间，由负责事实判断的环节核对。缺少数据或数据冲突时保持“待验证”。若终态要求业务验收，签字应单独核验，不能由字段齐全推定。\n\n验证时重放这两份相反结论：没有库存数据时，两份都不得标为事实通过；提供同一份有效库存记录后，只允许与记录一致的结论通过；数据冲突或缺少必要签字时，不得标为最终验收通过。这是建议的验证办法，尚未执行。","actual_material_paths":["docs/methodologies/wae.md","skills/wae/SKILL.md"],"counts":{"A1_direct_host_used":1,"A1_native_host_used":2,"B1_extra_budget_used":1,"B1_host_remaining":3,"B1_host_used":1,"B1_original_optional_second_layer_unused":1,"B1_total_jev_attempts":2,"host_exact_generation_attempt_count":null,"host_underlying_http_count":null,"new_host_cli_starts":1,"new_jev_calls":1,"new_observed_internal_recoveries":0,"new_successful_generation_works":2,"new_unknown_logical_calls":0,"old_risk_accepted_unknown_logical_calls":1,"outer_retries":0,"total_jev_attempts_including_old":3},"limitations":["old remote request remains unknown despite successful compensation","no proof of no overlap or duplicate cost","first usable result retained, no output selection","B1/native not run; no paired quality/performance result","A1 old transport mismatch remains excluded from performance comparison"],"new_call_key":"05ff7650c4f16af70592214af2ae4b3c6256f8a5650f8bfd556a9addd2eb25e8","old_call_key":"61784cbf0798ceba12ce2b8dcf0c90a97799011df3848a5904ac0cc9f595a31c","paths":[{"arm":"native","case":"A1","status":"delivered_old_execution_limited"},{"arm":"direct","case":"A1","status":"delivered_v2"},{"arm":"native","case":"B1","status":"UNRUN"},{"arm":"direct","case":"B1","status":"delivered_owner_approved_compensation_old_unknown_retained"},{"arm":"native","case":"C1","status":"UNRUN"},{"arm":"direct","case":"C1","status":"UNRUN"},{"arm":"native","case":"D1","status":"UNRUN"},{"arm":"direct","case":"D1","status":"UNRUN"},{"arm":"native","case":"E-window","status":"UNRUN"},{"arm":"direct","case":"E-window","status":"UNRUN"},{"arm":"nati